Rogue Network FORGE V4 pool reference implementation

Based on github.com/HawyUkr/open-progpow-pool and its upstream contributors.
The inherited LICENSE (GNU GPL version 3) and source copyright notices are retained.
Historical OGG / FORGE V3 identifiers in codecs, fixtures and storage are intentional.
Do not rename consensus domains or ledger keys as a branding change.
Node crypto dependencies for the optional wallet service come from Rogue-Network;
retain that project's COPYING, COPYING.LESSER and third-party notices when distributing it.
Private keys, RPC credentials, wallet files, ledgers and production backups are not supplied.
